  "prefLabel": "Tre 101.01 Treasurer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tre 101.01 \"Treasurer\" means the treasurer of the state of New Hampshire duly elected by the general court of New Hampshire pursuant to Const. N.H., Pt 2, Art. 67, RSA 6:1 and RSA 14:2-b.\n\nSource. #7588, eff 11-7-01; ss by #9574, eff 10-22-09",
